@host = http://localhost:5191
# A token from: dotnet user-jwts create --project samples/FileService --name alice -o token
@token = paste-a-token-here

### Upload a file; its type comes from its extension
PUT {{host}}/files/notes/hello.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

hello, resourcefull

### Upload it only if it doesn't exist yet: 412 if it does
PUT {{host}}/files/notes/hello.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-None-Match: *

hello again

### A type the service doesn't accept, whatever type the request claims: 415
PUT {{host}}/files/run.exe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: image/png

MZ

### List your files
GET {{host}}/files/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download part of a file: 206
GET {{host}}/files/notes/hello.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Range: bytes=7-

### How much of your quota you've used
GET {{host}}/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Share a file for a day; open the url it returns without a token
POST {{host}}/files/share/notes/hello.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a file
DELETE {{host}}/files/notes/hello.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Is the service ready for requests?
GET {{host}}/health/ready
